# 🧭 9. Best Practices for PowerShell in IT Support

- Always run scripts in a test environment first  
- Add comments to every script  
- Use `-WhatIf` for destructive commands  
- Log outputs for evidence  
- Use functions for reusability  
- Avoid running scripts from unknown sources  
- Validate user input  
- Use Microsoft Graph for cloud automation  

